  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the toor dal and soak it in water for 30 minutes",
    "Drain and rinse the toor dal again",
    "In a large pot, heat the olive oil over medium heat",
    "Add the chopped onion and cook until softened",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for another minute",
    "Add the cumin, paprika, salt, and black pepper, and stir for 1 minute",
    "Add the toor dal, water, and malt extract to the pot",
    "Bring the mixture to a boil, then reduce the heat to low and simmer for 20 minutes",
    "Stir the dal occasionally to prevent sticking",
    "Serve the dal hot, garnished with chopped fresh herbs if desired"
